From: PureGero <puregero@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Nov 2021 01:58:28 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Forward packets to the real player

Forwards packets to the real player by sending them to the external server that
hosts the player. Packets destined for multiple external players are batched
into a single SendPacketPacket per tick to avoid duplicates.

---
